WEBVTT

00:06:59.311 --> 00:07:02.067
and they are jobs, stability and education,

00:07:02.067 --> 00:07:04.400
not moral policing.

00:07:04.400 --> 00:07:05.468
But most of all,

00:07:05.468 --> 00:07:06.899
for the first time in decades,

00:07:06.899 --> 00:07:10.649
they expect to be active participants, not spectators,

00:07:10.649 --> 00:07:12.950
in the affairs of their country.

00:07:12.950 --> 00:07:16.966
I was meeting with a group of newly-elected parliamentarians

00:07:16.966 --> 00:07:18.501
from Egypt and Tunisia

00:07:18.501 --> 00:07:20.033
a couple of weeks ago.

00:07:20.033 --> 00:07:22.811
And what really struck me about them

00:07:22.811 --> 00:07:28.000
was that they weren't only optimistic,

00:07:28.000 --> 00:07:30.842
but they kind of struck me as nervous,